      "widgets_values": [
        "# FLUX.1 dev · GGUF · Apple Silicon\n\nBy **Agustí Figueras** · github.com/AGUS-LAIAMEDIA/comfyui-workflows\n\nBase text-to-image for FLUX.1 [dev] quantized to **Q5_K_S**, so it fits in 24 GB of unified memory on a Mac.\n\n- Needs the **ComfyUI-GGUF** custom node.\n- Write prompts as prose, not comma lists.\n- CFG stays at **1.0**. Steer with **FluxGuidance** (3.0–3.5).\n- At CFG 1.0 the negative prompt has no effect, so it stays empty.\n- **1280 × 544** = 2.35:1 scope frame.\n- Sampler **euler** + scheduler **simple**. Avoid karras / exponential on FLUX."
      ],
